{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"rows\": [\n    {\n      \"form\": \"连贯\",\n      \"text\": \"他先把回去的事放一边；前面那种缓慢、宽广的歌唱短暂回来，像心里熟悉的柔软处重新打开，让人又能认出那种沉思、近乎祈求的气息。他想起曾被当作自己人，心里暖了一会儿，却没因此想回头。\",\n      \"keys\": [\"缓慢、宽广的歌唱\", \"曾被当作自己人\"],\n      \"emotion\": \"安心\",\n      \"from\": [\"S08-1\", \"S08-B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"form\": \"散落\",\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"刚认出，还没安顿就退去\",\n          \"from\": [\"S08-B2\"],\n          \"bars\": \"206–213\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"像准备离开时最后回头\",\n          \"from\": [\"S08-B2\"],\n          \"bars\": \"206–213\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"看一眼刚才待过的地方\",\n          \"from\": [\"S08-B2\"],\n          \"bars\": \"206–213\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"那一眼温柔，也不舍\",\n          \"from\": [\"S08-B2\"],\n          \"bars\": \"206–213\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"form\": \"连贯\",\n      \"text\": \"可那份安静停留得太短；一想到以后真遇上难事，回忆没法陪着他，那点暖意很快就淡了，心又悬了起来。\",\n      \"keys\": [\"停留得太短\", \"心又悬了起来\"],\n      \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n      \"from\": [\"S08-2\", \"S08-B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"激烈思绪间，歌唱回来，胸口仿佛吸进一口气\",\n      \"bars\": \"206–213\",\n      \"from\": [\"S08-B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"只是瞬间喘息，不等于整个人安顿\",\n      \"bars\": \"206–213\",\n      \"from\": [\"S08-B3\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a4a00121-2b57-4dd6-a4ec-fad6439e4071", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T222949563803Z", "elapsed_seconds": 263.594, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:34:13.180490+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "